---
import Header from './Header.astro';
---

<section class="relative min-h-screen flex flex-col bg-primary overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.04]" style="background-image:
    linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,.12) 1px, transparent 1px),
    linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,.12) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 80px 80px;">
  </div>

  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_center,_transparent_0%,_var(--color-primary-dark)_100%)]" opacity-60 />

  <div class="relative flex-1 flex flex-col">
    <Header />

    <div class="flex-1 flex items-center">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 w-full">
        <div class="max-w-4xl py-16 md:py-24 mx-auto text-center">
          <div class="w-16 h-px bg-accent mb-10 mx-auto" />

          <p class="text-white/40 text-xs md:text-sm tracking-[0.3em] uppercase mb-6 font-medium">
            Escribania
          </p>

          <h1 class="font-serif text-5xl sm:text-6xl md:text-8xl text-white leading-none tracking-tight mb-6">
            Togcani
          </h1>

          <p class="text-white/50 text-base md:text-lg max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed mb-10 font-light">
            Seguridad juridica y confianza en cada acto notarial. Dos decadas de excelencia al servicio de nuestros clientes.
          </p>

          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 justify-center">
            <a
              href="#servicios"
              class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 bg-accent hover:bg-accent-light text-primary-dark font-medium px-9 py-3.5 text-sm tracking-widest uppercase transition-colors duration-300"
            >
              Nuestros servicios
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" />
              </svg>
            </a>
            <a
              href="#contacto"
              class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 text-white border border-white/15 hover:border-white/30 font-medium px-9 py-3.5 text-sm tracking-widest uppercase transition-colors duration-300"
            >
              Contacto
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="border-t border-white/8">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-8 md:py-12">
        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6 md:gap-0 md:divide-x divide-white/8">
          <div class="md:pr-10">
            <p class="font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl text-accent mb-2">01</p>
            <h3 class="text-white text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-1.5 font-medium">Confianza</h3>
            <p class="text-white/35 text-xs leading-relaxed max-w-xs">Fe publica y transparencia en cada acto notarial que intervenimos.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="md:px-10">
            <p class="font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl text-accent mb-2">02</p>
            <h3 class="text-white text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-1.5 font-medium">Excelencia</h3>
            <p class="text-white/35 text-xs leading-relaxed max-w-xs">Rigor tecnico juridico con atencion personalizada en cada tramite.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="md:pl-10">
            <p class="font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl text-accent mb-2">03</p>
            <h3 class="text-white text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-1.5 font-medium">Trayectoria</h3>
            <p class="text-white/35 text-xs leading-relaxed max-w-xs">Mas de dos decadas de experiencia y profesionalismo.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
